  {"id":"m-tacos","cat":"일상","title":"단골 타코집 추천","situ":"친구에게 동네 맛집을 소개할 때","lines":[{"en":"Hands down, the best tacos in town are at a tiny spot on Fifth Street.","ko":"단연코, 이 동네 최고의 타코는 5번가에 있는 작은 가게예요.","marks":["Hands down","in town","spot"],"chunks":[{"en":"Hands down,","ko":"단연코","st":"HANDS DOWN","k":"hands down"},{"en":"the best tacos in town","ko":"이 동네 최고의 타코는","st":"the BEST TAcos in TOWN","k":"in town"},{"en":"are at a tiny spot","ko":"작은 가게에 있어요","st":"are at a TIny SPOT","k":"spot"},{"en":"on Fifth Street.","ko":"5번가에","st":"on FIFTH STREET"}],"links":[["hands down","hanz-down"],["are at a","ar-ra-duh"]],"idioms":[["hands down","단연코, 두말할 것 없이"],["in town","이 동네에서"],["spot","가게, 장소 (구어)"]]},{"en":"From the outside, it doesn't look like much, but don't let that fool you.","ko":"겉보기엔 별거 없어 보이는데, 속지 마세요.","marks":["doesn't look like much","don't let that fool you"],"chunks":[{"en":"From the outside,","ko":"겉보기엔","st":"From the OUTside"},{"en":"it doesn't look like much,","ko":"별거 없어 보이지만","st":"it DOESn't LOOK like MUCH","k":"not look like much"},{"en":"but don't let that","ko":"하지만 그 인상에","st":"but DON'T LET that","k":"don't let ~ fool you"},{"en":"fool you.","ko":"속지 마세요","st":"FOOL you","k":"don't let ~ fool you"}],"links":[["look like","loo-klike"],["let that","le(t)-that"]],"idioms":[["not look like much","별로 대단해 보이지 않다"],["don't let ~ fool you","~에 속지 마"]]},{"en":"Lines tend to get pretty long around noon, so getting there early is a must.","ko":"점심때쯤엔 줄이 꽤 길어져서, 일찍 가는 게 필수예요.","marks":["tend to","a must"],"chunks":[{"en":"Lines tend to","ko":"줄은 보통","st":"LINES TEND to","k":"tend to"},{"en":"get pretty long","ko":"꽤 길어져요","st":"get PREtty LONG"},{"en":"around noon,","ko":"정오쯤에","st":"around NOON"},{"en":"so getting there early","ko":"그러니 일찍 가는 게","st":"so GETting there EARly"},{"en":"is a must.","ko":"필수예요","st":"is a MUST","k":"a must"}],"links":[["tend to","ten-da"],["getting there","geh-din-there"]],"idioms":[["tend to","~하는 경향이 있다"],["a must","필